            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580489944761-15a19d654956?w=400&h=560&fit=crop&crop=face" alt="Meera Nair"/>
            <div class="card-overlay-grad"><div class="card-name-label">Meera Nair</div><span class="cbadge cbadge-pink">#Schengen</span></div>
